cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the PRT model, please cite the paper below."
title: "PRT: A Persistence-Residual Transformer for sub-daily Fire Radiative Power trajectory forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, deployed model checkpoints, and reproducibility
  materials for the IEEE GRSL letter on sub-daily Fire Radiative Power (FRP)
  trajectory forecasting over Mediterranean wildfires using a
  Persistence-Residual Transformer (PRT) with Skill-Score-Aligned Training
  (SSAT) and engineered wind features (WindFeats), driven by MSG-SEVIRI FRP
  and ERA5 covariates.
